{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "80815d4c-cc2e-8893-898b-9fdcd831a3ce",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:44:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I'm calling about a manhole cover. Can you hear me okay? I'm in a bad spot for signal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got you, a little choppy but go ahead. A manhole cover, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sorry. It's sunk down in the road, and every time a car goes over it it rings, like a clang, loud. It's been worse since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sunk and clanging. Got it. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's in front of 379 Kay Street. I'm calling for my mother, she lives there. It's up in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three seventy-nine Kay Street, Historic Hill. Writing that down. And how big are we talking, the cover itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, sorry, about two feet across, I'd say. Round, the usual kind. [line breaks up] the edge is lower than the pavement around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. The edge is lower than the pavement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sorry. It dropped down maybe a couple inches on one side. [inaudible] you can feel it when you drive over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so sunk on one side, about two feet across, rings when cars cross. Is it in the travel lane or off to the side by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's right in the lane, kind of toward the middle. Cars can't really avoid it unless they swerve. The pizza place across from the park is down the road, and that's where my kids spend Fridays, so I'm on that street a lot. I just worry somebody's going to get a flat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that makes sense. Lots of foot traffic around there too. I'll put it in as a road hazard so a crew can take a look and see whether it needs to be reset or just patched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, thank you. Do you think it'd be soon? I know you've probably got a ton of calls after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do have a pile after the weekend. I'd guess a few days to a week or so for an inspection, depending on what else comes in ahead of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Sorry, could I get a reference number? So my mother can call back if she needs to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Hang on, let me finish the entry. [pause] Okay, it's coming up now. Do you want a callback number on it too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, yes please. It's four oh one, five five five, zero one five zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one five zero. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Julio Rivera. Sorry, R-I-V-E-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Julio. Your reference number is PW dash two six, zero two two five, dash one four. I'll read it back. PW, two six, zero two two five, one four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, [line breaks up] was that two six, zero two two five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, then dash one four at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it written down. Sorry for all the questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Thanks for calling it in, Julio. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:44:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
